  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Some rows keep their own level although they have a template, so each must be changed on its own: `TGCrownGhost02` 084D16 (from `TGCrownGhostBase`, both 12); the advcyrus `…Melee1H_Male` 000969 and `…Male2` 000980 (from `…Melee1H_Female`) and `…MissileM` 000974 (from `…MissileF`, at level 1 against the female's PC×1.2); the Ghost Captain 000AA4 (from `LvlBanditGhostMelee2HMale`); the Forelhost wizards (from `dunForelhostLvlGhostBase`); and the Dwarven Spectre (from `EncBandit01TemplateMagic` 039D31, level 1).",
      "The ghost wizards `encGhost01Magic`–`06Magic` carry `Stats` from the bandit magic templates `EncBandit0NTemplateMagic` (on *Common Bandits*), so changing those templates changes them.",
      "Every other ghost record (Halldir's, Haknir's Crew, the Yngvild and Rannveig ghosts, the Sanctuary Guardians, the Forelhost melee and tank cultists, the Labyrinthian spirits, `TGCrownGhost01`/`03` and the Ysgramor's Tomb ghosts) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
